<title>AUSTRALIA: GOLF-AUSTRALIAN PGA CHAMPIONSHIP THIRD ROUND SCORES.</title>
<headline>GOLF-AUSTRALIAN PGA CHAMPIONSHIP THIRD ROUND SCORES.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1996-11-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Leading third round scores in the</p>
<p>Australian PGA championship at the par-72 New South Wales course</p>
<p>on Saturday (Australian unless stated):</p>
<p>204 Chris Gray 68 70 66</p>
<p>210 Jerry Kelly (U.S.) 73 66 71, Peter Lonard 69 69 72</p>
<p>211 Anthony Painter 71 69 71, Justin Cooper 70 68 73</p>
<p>212 Phillip Tataurangi (New Zealand) 71 72 69, Terry</p>
<p>Price 72 72 68, Lyndsay Stephen 71 74 67</p>
<p>213 Rodger Davis 71 73 69, Wayne Smith 66 77 70, Paul Gow</p>
<p>76 68 69</p>
<p>214 Jeff Wagner 70 74 70, Brad King 72 70 72, Michael</p>
<p>Long (New Zealand) 70 75 69, Ben Oxley 71 75 68, Gary</p>
<p>Evans (Britain) 72 71 71.</p>
</text>
